  "stem": "Two particles are executing simple harmonic motion of the same amplitude A and frequency ω along the x-axis. Their mean positions are separated by distance $X_{0}\\ (X_{0} > A)$. If the maximum separation between them is ($X_{0} + A$), the phase difference between their motion is:",
  "options": {
    "A": "$\\pi/3$",
    "B": "$\\pi/4$",
    "C": "$\\pi/6$",
    "D": "$\\pi/2$"
  },
